<p>Jab kabhi gheerate insaa'n ka sawaal aata hai<br />
Binte zahra tere parde ka qayaal aata hai</p>

<p>Darmiyaa'n laasho ke tanha nazar aate hai hussain<br />
Jab ke aashoor ke sooraj pa zawaal aata hai</p>

<p>Mout kis sonch me hai laashae akber pa khadi<br />
Kya payambar ki jawaani ka qayaal aata hai</p>

<p>Mutthiyaa'n bheenj ke pheri hai zabaa'n hoto'n par<br />
jab ke shashmaahe pa hyder ka jalaal aata hai</p>

<p>Badh ke abbas kaleje se laga lete hai<br />
Jab sakina ki yateemi ka qayaal aata hai</p>

<p>Kya hataaega koi nehr se qaime sheh ke<br />
Baazue sibte payambar ko jalaal aata hai</p>

<p>Khoo'n bhara kurta utha leti hai badhkar zainab<br />
Jab ke darbaar me loota hua maal aata hai</p>